-rid="9eed2055-bfc4-4a7f-8c01-55858d0ab846" aria-controls="replo-:R1qj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1kl19uy"><div data-rid="6db85356-077b-44bf-8f39-5eceb9c9aa2c" class="r-1j4c1d alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>How much protein is in each serving of Retaur protein yogurt?</h3></span></div><div data-rid="8e9ff187-3031-4e93-a5a2-6120e88d3c0f" class="r-pc1l96"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-73zlab" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R1qj2:"><div data-rid="721dde6a-3a97-4064-9d6d-5f9832f1e5b8" class="r-1hm5w86"><div data-rid="78d8552e-52b0-40a5-b853-7b4823eac7a3" class="r-1tsjfkq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Each cup of Retaur protein yogurt contains 50g of high-quality protein. This substantial amount helps support muscle recovery, satiety, and your daily protein requirements in a convenient, delicious format.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="00d2129a-5123-4a99-a237-dc380b762aa7" class="r-10u8ukl"></div><div data-rid="f1f7b2f1-b77b-4d6c-b35c-b5cfbaa613ac" class="r-j4fvep" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="390eb54a-5b5f-4107-a2ed-bcd115b43a00" aria-controls="replo-:R2qj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-18yfpv4"><div data-rid="56da8d95-def9-493c-b939-4d7610491180" class="r-1lxurwi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How does Retaur protein yogurt compare to regular Greek yogurt?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6a4a0c34-7a42-4db4-a45c-078c47fdd264" class="r-191r6fy"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1tlcc9e" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2qj2:"><div data-rid="68c12122-bc9b-47cb-8085-9c4592687ff6" class="r-1l5ldih"><div data-rid="6ff2bbc7-3138-4d8f-a1f2-5b80f73502e7" class="r-1qase3w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Retaur protein yogurt offers significantly higher protein content (50g per cup) compared to regular Greek yogurt (typically 5-10g). Our protein yogurt is specially formulated with added whey protein for optimal muscle support while maintaining the creamy texture you love. It also contains less sugar than many commercial Greek yogurts while delivering more targeted nutritional benefits for active lifestyles, all without sacrificing taste.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b16c4bab-9e46-437d-91ed-5a2cd4082c58" class="r-ms5c8v"></div><div data-rid="1a761829-a842-495c-9a51-ccba18493f6c" class="r-1s8zhq" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="4457269c-75bd-4790-b51d-abf335770ac0" aria-controls="replo-:R3qj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ziymwh"><div data-rid="ebc58098-f62d-45eb-8074-728d4c4dd4f2" class="r-46fkr0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What are the ingredients in Retaur protein yogurt?</p></span></div><div data-rid="751d1945-5d3c-405a-9e9b-b5c4de30236e" class="r-s52tz4"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-182v7im" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R3qj2:"><div data-rid="4997990b-fa84-417c-86c0-8a8a1d19b63a" class="r-whtxue"><div data-rid="288a4de1-5423-40ce-8de1-aaf2e4a176c7" class="r-1jk688r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Retaur protein yogurt contains pasteurized milk, live active cultures, whey protein concentrate, natural flavors, and a touch of sugar for sweetness. Our protein yogurt is free from artificial preservatives, colors, and excessive added sugars. We prioritize clean, simple ingredients to deliver maximum nutritional benefit with minimal additives.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="bfb0ae10-9084-413a-9c46-4c2cb5bb6dad" class="r-16hnboz"></div><div data-rid="e88d82fb-bd0d-45ab-8b14-880b86bb50a6" class="r-1ys8aib" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="fb2d1ed8-7b72-429b-a4ee-9a9890b7177d" aria-controls="replo-:R4qj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-i82vg8"><div data-rid="720a27c2-981a-4411-b5bc-bf5460aa2653" class="r-1kzyfab alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I enjoy Retaur protein yogurt if I'm trying to lose weight?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f400aba8-9798-40e3-b53a-63bc61d3c931" class="r-wyq9t9"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1a80ap2" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4qj2:"><div data-rid="a8313d1a-9d1f-46fe-8f68-4c1a45f0cdf6" class="r-1e8wf1l"><div data-rid="e03987cf-8c26-4a75-be80-5cb447bac505" class="r-4bk8xy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely! Retaur protein yogurt is an excellent choice for weight management goals. The high protein content promotes satiety (feeling full longer), while the balanced nutritional profile provides essential nutrients without excessive calories. It makes for a satisfying snack that can help reduce overall calorie intake by preventing hunger between meals.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="db4af330-7f32-41bb-b979-